===Format===
* '''Stage 1:''' ''March 1<sup>st</sup> - 5<sup>th</sup>, 2025''
** 16 Team Swiss System Format
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
*** Top 8 teams proceed to Stage 2
** {{Swiss Explained/ESL 2025|toggleGroup=1}}

* '''Stage 2:''' ''March 7<sup>th</sup> - 11<sup>th</sup>, 2025''
** 16 Team Swiss System Format
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
*** Top 8 teams proceed to Playoffs
** {{Swiss Explained/ESL 2025|toggleGroup=2}}

* '''Playoffs:''' ''March 13<sup>th</sup> - 16<sup>th</sup>, 2025''
** Single-Elimination bracket
** Quarterfinals and Semifinals are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}}

